    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"<h3 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><b>Школа глубокого обучения ФПМИ МФТИ</b></h3>\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"<h1 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><b>Домашнее задание по теме \\\"Механизм внимания.</b></h1>\\n\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"id\": \"UAr-M8_1GJ6W\"\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"Это домашнее задание проходит в формате peer-review. Это означает, что его будут проверять ваши однокурсники. Поэтому пишите разборчивый код, добавляйте комментарии и пишите выводы после проделанной работы.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"В этом задании вы будете решать задачу классификации математических задач по темам (многоклассовая классификация) с помощью Transformer.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"В качестве датасета возьмем датасет математических задач по разным темам. Нам необходим следующий файл:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"[Файл с классами](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/13YIbphbWc62sfa-bCh8MLQWKizaXbQK9/edit?usp=drive_link&ouid=104379615679964018037&rtpof=true&sd=true)\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"id\": \"1fybMcmV0YRA\"\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"**Hint:** не перезаписывайте модели, которые вы получите на каждом из этапов этого дз. Они ещё понадобятся.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"### Импорт библиотек\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:49.058031Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:49.053700Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import torch\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from transformers import AutoModel, AutoConfig\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from transformers import get_linear_schedule_with_warmup\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import torch.nn as nn\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 19\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:49.290602Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:49.287499Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import copy\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from typing import Union, Dict\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from typing import Optional, List\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from tqdm import tqdm\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 20\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"id\": \"t395freCxpOE\"\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### Задание 1 (2 балла)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Напишите кастомный класс для модели трансформера для задачи классификации, использующей в качествке backbone какую-то из моделей huggingface.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Т.е. конструктор класса должен принимать на вход название модели и подгружать её из huggingface, а затем использовать в качестве backbone (достаточно возможности использовать в качестве backbone те модели, которые упомянуты в последующих пунктах)\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:51.090497Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:51.085423Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"class TransformerClassificationModel(nn.Module):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def __init__(self, base_transformer_model: Union[str, nn.Module], num_labels: int = 2, dropout: float = 0.1):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        super().__init__()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Загрузка backbone модели\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if isinstance(base_transformer_model, str):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            self.backbone = AutoModel.from_pretrained(base_transformer_model)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            self.config = AutoConfig.from_pretrained(base_transformer_model)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            self.backbone = base_transformer_model\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            self.config = base_transformer_model.config\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Дополнительные слои для классификации\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(dropout)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        self.classifier = nn.Linear(self.config.hidden_size, num_labels)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    def forward(self, inputs: Dict[str, torch.Tensor]) -> Dict[str, torch.Tensor]:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Пропускаем через backbone\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        outputs = self.backbone(**inputs)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Берем [CLS] token для классификации\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        pooled_output = outputs.last_hidden_state[:, 0, :]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Пропускаем через classification head\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        pooled_output = self.dropout(pooled_output)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        logits = self.classifier(pooled_output)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        outputs = {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'logits': logits,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'hidden_states': outputs.hidden_states,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            'attentions': outputs.attentions\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        }\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        return outputs\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 21\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"id\": \"Vd3kxX6hy0d4\"\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### Задание 2 (1 балл)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Напишите функцию заморозки backbone у модели (если необходимо, возвращайте из функции модель)\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"id\": \"U8IuDosbzKe8\",\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:52.010246Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:52.004343Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"def freeze_backbone_function(model: TransformerClassificationModel, freeze_layers: Optional[List[int]] = None,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                             unfreeze_classifier: bool = True) -> TransformerClassificationModel:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    Расширенная функция заморозки backbone с дополнительными опциями.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    Args:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        model: Экземпляр TransformerClassificationModel\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        freeze_layers: Список номеров слоев для заморозки (если None - все слои)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        unfreeze_classifier: Размораживать ли classification head\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    Returns:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        TransformerClassificationModel: Модель с замороженными слоями\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if freeze_layers is None:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Замораживаем весь backbone\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        for param in model.backbone.parameters():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            param.requires_grad = False\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Выборочная заморозка определенных слоев\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        for layer_idx, layer in enumerate(model.backbone.encoder.layer):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            if layer_idx in freeze_layers:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                for param in layer.parameters():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                    param.requires_grad = False\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Управление заморозкой classification head\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if unfreeze_classifier:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        for param in model.classifier.parameters():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            param.requires_grad = True\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Размораживаем другие дополнительные слои\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if hasattr(model, 'dropout'):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            for param in model.dropout.parameters():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                param.requires_grad = True\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    return model\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 22\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"id\": \"kybkw6MSzd-K\"\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### Задание 3 (2 балла)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Напишите функцию, которая будет использована для тренировки (дообучения) трансформера (TransformerClassificationModel). Функция должна поддерживать обучение с замороженным и размороженным backbone.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:54.113281Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2025-11-06T11:08:54.102809Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"def train_transformer(transformer_model, freeze_backbone=True, train_loader=None, val_loader=None,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                      num_epochs=3, learning_rate=2e-5, warmup_steps=0):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    Функция для дообучения TransformerClassificationModel\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    Args:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        transformer_model: Исходная модель для дообучения\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        freeze_backbone: Замораживать ли backbone\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        train_loader: DataLoader для тренировочных данных\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        val_loader: DataLoader для валидационных данных\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        num_epochs: Количество эпох\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        learning_rate: Скорость обучения\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        warmup_steps: Количество шагов для warmup\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    Returns:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        TransformerClassificationModel: Дообученная модель\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Создаем глубокую копию модели для безопасного изменения\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model = copy.deepcopy(transformer_model)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    device = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model.to(device)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Замораживаем backbone если необходимо\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if freeze_backbone:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        for param in model.backbone.parameters():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            param.requires_grad = False\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        print(\\\"Backbone заморожен. Обучается только classification head.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        print(\\\"Backbone разморожен. Обучается вся модель.\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Настраиваем оптимизатор - только для параметров, которые требуют градиентов\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    trainable_params = [p for p in model.parameters() if p.requires_grad]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(trainable_params, lr=learning_rate)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Функция потерь\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Создаем фиктивные данные если не переданы\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if train_loader is None:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        print(\\\"Внимание: train_loader не передан, используется фиктивный DataLoader\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Создаем фиктивные данные для демонстрации\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        class DummyDataset(torch.utils.data.Dataset):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            def __len__(self): return 100\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            def __getitem__(self, idx):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                return {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                    'input_ids': torch.randint(0, 1000, (128,)),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                    'attention_mask': torch.ones(128),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                    'labels': torch.randint(0, model.classifier.out_features, (1,)).item()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                }\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        train_loader = DataLoader(DummyDataset(), batch_size=8)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        val_loader = DataLoader(DummyDataset(), batch_size=8)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Настраиваем планировщик обучения\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    total_steps = len(train_loader) * num_epochs\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    scheduler = get_linear_schedule_with_warmup(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        optimizer,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        num_warmup_steps=warmup_steps,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        num_training_steps=total_steps\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Цикл обучения\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model.train()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for epoch in range(num_epochs):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        total_loss = 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        progress_bar = tqdm(train_loader, desc=f'Epoch {epoch + 1}/{num_epochs}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        for batch in progress_bar:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            # Переносим данные на устройство\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            inputs = {k: v.to(device) for k, v in batch.items() if k != 'labels'}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            labels = batch['labels'].to(device)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            # Forward pass\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            optimizer.zero_grad()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            outputs = model(inputs)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            logits = outputs['logits']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            # Вычисление потерь\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            loss = criterion(logits, labels)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            # Backward pass\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            loss.backward()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            optimizer.step()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            scheduler.step()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            total_loss += loss.item()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            progress_bar.set_postfix({'loss': f'{loss.item():.4f}'})\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        # Валидация после каждой эпохи\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        if val_loader is not None:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            val_loss, val_accuracy = evaluate_model(model, val_loader, criterion, device)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            print(f'Epoch {epoch + 1}: Train Loss: {total_loss / len(train_loader):.4f}, '\\n\",\n",
    "    \"                  f'Val Loss: {val_loss:.4f}, Val Acc: {val_accuracy:.4f}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            print(f'Epoch {epoch + 1}: Train Loss: {total_loss / len(train_loader):.4f}')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"Дообучение завершено!\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    return model\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"def evaluate_model(model, val_loader, criterion, device):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"\\\"\\\"Функция для оценки модели на валидационных данных\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model.eval()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    total_loss = 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    correct = 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    total = 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    with torch.no_grad():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        for batch in val_loader:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            inputs = {k: v.to(device) for k, v in batch.items() if k != 'labels'}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            labels = batch['labels'].to(device)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            outputs = model(inputs)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            logits = outputs['logits']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            loss = criterion(logits, labels)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            total_loss += loss.item()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            _, predicted = torch.max(logits, 1)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            correct += (predicted == labels).sum().item()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"            total += labels.size(0)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model.train()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    return total_loss / len(val_loader), correct / total\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 23\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
